<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (Without explicit AI-literacy components, including critical engagement with AI-mediated content, data rights and algorithmic bias, GenAI may encourage over-reliance rather than learning: by removing the effort and errors through which students learn, it can raise performance during practice while lowering what students can do on their own \(Bastani et al., 2025\). Implementing and measuring these programmes would benefit from a robust global research effort.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [0]
>>
